'' A POINTER IN A COMPOUND ASSIGNMENT OTHER THAN '+=' / '-=' -- fbc's error 20, measured on
'' fbc-modern 1.20 (2026-10-13), and TKO0820 here, as the binary operator already was. Over an
'' integer target with a pointer value, and over a pointer target with a number. tiko
'' compiled every one. 'n += p' stays TKO0968 (fbc's warning 5); 'p += 2' and 'p -= 2' are
'' pointer arithmetic and silent.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir %s
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: (28,1): error TKO0820: no operator '*' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (29,1): error TKO0820: no operator '/' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (30,1): error TKO0820: no operator '\' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (31,1): error TKO0820: no operator 'mod' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (32,1): error TKO0820: no operator 'and' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (33,1): error TKO0820: no operator 'or' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (34,1): error TKO0820: no operator 'xor' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (35,1): error TKO0820: no operator 'shl' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (36,1): error TKO0820: no operator 'shr' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (37,1): error TKO0820: no operator '^' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (38,1): error TKO0820: no operator '*' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (39,1): error TKO0820: no operator 'and' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: (40,1): error TKO0820: no operator 'shl' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-NOT: (26,
'' EXPECT-NOT: (27,
'' EXPECT-NOT: (41,
'' EXPECT-NOT: (42,
dim as long ptr lp
dim as integer n
n *= lp
n /= lp
n \= lp
n mod= lp
n and= lp
n or= lp
n xor= lp
n shl= lp
n shr= lp
n ^= lp
lp *= 2
lp and= 2
lp shl= 1
lp += 2
lp -= 2
